# FENNEC FOUNTAIN: the fennec walks one tile at a time and takes its time
# (Block Koala's koala is slow): a step every 12 frames while a direction is
# held, and a tap during a step waits for it. Rooms are entered from the
# garden with A at a hut.
game fennec
wait 30
press A
wait 20
press A
wait 5
expect state == 1
# stand in front of room 1's hut and go in
cheat hub 1 14
wait 5
press A
wait 5
expect state == 2
expect room == 1
expect px == 1
hold RIGHT 26
expect px == 4
wait 12
# the next tile pushes the water stone
hold RIGHT 2
wait 12
expect px == 5
expect tile61 == 0
expect tile62 == 40
